<title>USA: Anicom Inc sells units, opens offices.</title>
<headline>Anicom Inc sells units, opens offices.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anicom Inc said Wednesday it sold its KITCO division and its Norfolk Systems unit, in addition to opening three offices in San Diego, Minneapolis and Rochester, New York.</p>
<p>The buyers and the terms of the deals were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Anicom said the three sales and distribution facilities will be fully operational by February, expanding its total number of locations nationwide to 33.</p>
<p>Anicom makes and markets multimedia wiring products used in the communications industry.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 7/8 Wednesday at 9-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
